      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "こいつがいるの忘れたの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前にテストしたけど、単に身体が頑丈なだけじゃないわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "それに掴まりなさい、ドクター！　あたしが大きな花火を打ち上げてあげる！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爆発の瞬間に、こいつにあんたを守らせながら全力で突っ込んでもらうから！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "分かったかしら、ペットちゃん？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（興奮した雄たけび）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "なら準備しなさい。三！　二！　一！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "「パァン」！"
