    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "よく見えない――",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "少し頭がクラクラする――",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "もう……すぐよ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "耳が少し……聞こえにくい……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "37_g9_airshipdockcorridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ふ、{@nickname}、調子はどう？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今また壁を触ってみたけど、あんたたちがそこまで正確に爆発地点に突っ込む必要はなかったみたいね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無駄につらい思いさせちゃって、ほんとごめんなさいね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（怒ったように爪を振り回す）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "危ないからじっとしてなさい。そいつの体格はあんたほどじゃないのよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Mon3tr、大丈夫だ、下ろしてくれ……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
